(Abstract) Tj T*
(Heat stress damages chloroplasts and reduces rice yield. We mapped qHT3, a QTL for seedling) Tj T*
(survival after heat stress, and identified two genes, HTR1 and HTR2, at this locus.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Introduction) Tj T*
(Heat stress damages chloroplasts and reduces grain yield in rice. How heat signals are) Tj T*
(transduced from the plasma membrane to chloroplasts remains unknown. The objective of this) Tj T*
(study was to identify genes underlying natural variation in thermotolerance.) Tj T*
